WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.866 --> 00:00:03.450
QA creates a disposable hourly contract for Cancel-3 through the contract wizard (October start)

2
00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:04.425
QA logs 30 minutes on Oct 18 and gets it approved; the October window is generated as a draft

3
00:00:04.425 --> 00:00:28.222
Glinda logs 30 minutes inside the same October period after the draft exists; QA approves her sheet

4
00:00:28.222 --> 00:00:37.944
Automatic Invoices names Glinda's entry as late time closed by the draft

5
00:00:37.944 --> 00:00:50.800
Reverse the draft: the window reopens and the entry is no longer late

6
00:00:50.800 --> 00:01:03.449
Regenerate October: both entries bill on the regenerated window, neither labelled late

7
00:01:03.449 --> 00:01:54.830
Cleanup through the product
